apple:axe:angle:able:ant 
Output APPLE:AXE:ANGLE:ABLE 
Explanation: The pattern requires words to begin with a and end with e, with any number of characters between them. ant does not end in e. */
import java.util.*;
public class q19searchdictionary {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);

        String pattern = sc.nextLine();
        String input = sc.nextLine();

        String[] words = input.split(":");
        StringBuilder result = new StringBuilder();

        char start = pattern.charAt(0);
        char end = pattern.charAt(pattern.length() - 1);

        for (String word : words) {
            String w = word.toLowerCase();

            if (w.startsWith(String.valueOf(start)) &&
                w.endsWith(String.valueOf(end))) {

                if (result.length() > 0) {
                    result.append(":");
                }

                result.append(w.toUpperCase());
            }
        }

        System.out.println(result.length() == 0 ? "NO-MATCH" : result);
    }
}
